# Normalise to LF in the repository, always.
#
# 🔴 This file is why this repo will not repeat `aeo-howto-web`'s problem. That
# repo has no `.gitattributes`, `core.autocrlf` is `true` on this machine, and
# the result is 9,216 prettier errors — every one `Delete ␍` — which makes its
# gate unfixable on a Windows checkout while passing cleanly on Linux CI. The
# defect is invisible to whoever committed it and unavoidable for whoever
# clones it next.
#
# `scripts/gate.sh` matters most: a shell script with CRLF line endings fails on
# Linux with `bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M`, which names neither the
# file nor the cause.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
